{"title": "Amulet of the Devout", "pageid": 11566, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Devout", "categories": ["Bugs", "Amulets", "Very rare items", "Cleric set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amulet_of_the_devout.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Amulet_of_the_devout.png/300px-Amulet_of_the_devout.png.webp, /w/images/c/c2/Amulet_of_the_devout.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Amulet of the Devout image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Amulet_of_the_devout.png/300px-Amulet_of_the_devout.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Amulet_of_the_devout.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Amulet of the Devout</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a>. It grants the wearer a +2 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw#The_Difficulty_Class_of_Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Spell Save DC</a> and, if the wearer has access to it, an additional use of <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Otto, a member of the powerful arcane organisation the Circle of Eight, had a penchant for amulets. So much so that they announced his arrival before he ever needed to.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 65 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  65  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1acf71e6-6bca-4d9b-9d24-739823e10723</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1acf71e6-6bca-4d9b-9d24-739823e10723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1acf71e6-6bca-4d9b-9d24-739823e10723\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfTheDevout_Amulet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/High_Spellcasting_(%2B2)\" title=\"High Spellcasting (+2)\">High Spellcasting</a></dt><dd>You gain a +2 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Godswill\" title=\"Godswill\">Godswill</a></dt><dd>You gain an additional use of <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a>. Once used, it is restored upon taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Godswill#Bugs\" title=\"Godswill\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;796&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1159</span>: In the main Offering Chest in the basement</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unless done by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> while wearing <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\">Khalid's Gift</a>, looting any of the items from the offering chests curses the interacting party member with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Castigated_By_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Castigated By Divinity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Castigated By Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Castigated_By_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Castigated By Divinity (Condition)\">Castigated By Divinity</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Godswill:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Contrary to the in-game description, the additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a> granted by Godswill restores on a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>. However if the extra charge is expended and the amulet is unequipped, the extra charge does not reappear if re-equipped before a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>; at this point it cannot be restored with a short rest.</li>\n<li>The additional Channel Divinity Charge does not incur the amulet's once-per-rest cooldown if spent on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wrath\" title=\"Destructive Wrath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/20px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/30px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/40px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Destructive Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/20px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wrath\" title=\"Destructive Wrath\">Destructive Wrath</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guided Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\">Guided Strike</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Touch_of_Death\" title=\"Touch of Death\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/20px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/30px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/40px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Touch of Death\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/20px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Touch_of_Death\" title=\"Touch of Death\">Touch of Death</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/20px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/30px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/40px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War God's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/20px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\">War God's Blessing</a>.  If spent in this manner, simply unequipping and reequipping the amulet restores the Channel Divinity Charge.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 358px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 356px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Model and render by Daniil Shashenkov &quot;Forild&quot;\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg/534px-Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg/800px-Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg/1067px-Daniil-shashenkov-forild-3.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Model and render by Daniil Shashenkov &quot;Forild&quot;\" src=\"/w/image